                        00038 	;
                        00039 	; CVBasic prologue (BASIC compiler, 6502 target)
                        00040 	;
                        00041 	; by Oscar Toledo G.
                        00042 	; https://nanochess.org/
                        00043 	;
                        00044 	; Creation date: May/13/2025.
                        00045 	; Revision date: Jul/20/2025. Added code to load sprites and read controllers.
                        00046 	; Revision date: Aug/23/2025. Support for writing VRAM and PRINT.
                        00047 	; Revision date: Aug/24/2025. Support for scrolling, SCREEN, and DISABLE/ENABLE.
                        00048 	;                             Added music player.
                        00049 	; Revision date: Aug/25/2025. Added support for 256K and 512K ROM.
                        00050 	; Revision date: Aug/26/2025. Added support for CHRRAM selection.
                        00051 	; Revision date: Feb/16/2026. Relocated PPUBUF.
                        00052 	; Revision date: Mar/25/2026. Faster _mul16 (using Y in loop) and _div16
                        00053 	;                             (avoids update using registers)
                        00054 	; Revision date: Mar/29/2026. Avoids unwinding stack for _mul16, _div16, _div16s,
                        00055 	;                             _mod16, and _mod16s.
                        00056 	;
                        00057 
