819C                    00803 ; FAMISTUDIO_SMOOTH_VIBRATO (internal)
819C                    00804 ;
819C                    00805 ; Implementation of Blaarg's smooth vibrato to eliminate pops on square channels. Called either from regular channel
819C                    00806 ; updates or from SFX code.
819C                    00807 ;
819C                    00808 ; [in] a : new hi period.
